# data folders
data/*
data/cache*
data/working*
# Except the RSGG GANs, trained models stored in data/<dataset>/GAN-* (their store path falls back to
# data/): shared like the oracles, or RSGG starts from different GANs on every clone.
!data/*/
data/*/*
!data/*/GAN-*
data/*/*.lck*
lab/data/cache*

# Shared caches (see docs/reproducing-experiments.md, section 4): the dataset caches (they hold the random fold splits),
# the trained oracles (re-saved on the CPU, tools/resave_cache_cpu.py) and the small trained explainer
# artifacts (DCM medoids, LST node-attribute method scores, hyperparameters). Every clone must use the
# same ones, or results stop being comparable. Walk back the negation through every level (gitignore
# won't re-include a file inside an ignored directory), then re-ignore what stays local.
!lab/data/
!lab/data/cache/
!lab/data/cache/datasets/
!lab/data/cache/oracles/
!lab/data/cache/oracles/*/
!lab/data/cache/explainers/
!lab/data/cache/explainers/*/
lab/data/cache/working/
lab/data/cache/**/*.lck*

# By default still ignore everything inside the per-dataset explainer dir,
# then surgically re-include just the artifact files we want to ship.
lab/data/cache/explainers/*/*
!lab/data/cache/explainers/*/DCM-*
!lab/data/cache/explainers/*/LSTMethodsArtifact-*
!lab/data/cache/explainers/*/LSTHyperparameters-*

# Re-ignore lock files / sidecars that look like our artifact name pattern.
lab/data/cache/explainers/**/*.lck*

lab/results_legacy*
lab/output_legacy/
lab/stats_legacy*
lab/pickles*
output/
# Results are tracked from the BLS selector onwards (docs/reproducing-experiments.md, section 4): lab/output/results with
# the per-instance counterfactual dumps, the runner logs gzipped (lab/output/queue_logs/*.log.gz) and the
# selector monitors. Raw *.log files and the rest of lab/output stay local.
!lab/output/
lab/output/*
!lab/output/results/
!lab/output/queue_logs/
!lab/output/selector_logs/
stats/
AAAI/
legacy/config-v2/_papers/
.DS_Store
experiments/
legacy/config-v2/Gretel1_AAAI/
evaluated/*
data/bardh_cache/*
old_experiments/


# Testing files
main_test.py
da_test.py

