Llama-3.2-1B
Llama-3.2-1B.zip

# Secrets. Credentials are read from the environment (see
# docs/reproducing-experiments.md); these patterns are a second line of
# defence so a local key file can never be committed by accident.
api_keys.txt
*.key
.env.local

